  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">학교에 돌이 많이 없네요ㅜ<br>이름 부탁드려요<br><br>1) 줄무늬가 있는 돌,,</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6d32d446a21ecb1e43aff5faeff5400ae510646\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6d32d446a21ecb1e43aff5faeff5400ae510646\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2) 사암 이려나요..?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a2c0214cdb55751e9818670ece99232417a92de\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a2c0214cdb55751e9818670ece99232417a92de\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3) 띠처럼 둘러져있는 돌은 대리암?인가요<br>4) 바닥에  직사각형처럼 되어있는 돌은 무슨돌 인가요??</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87b21acc446489035036cd764fdee7dbe11fabd9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87b21acc446489035036cd764fdee7dbe11fabd9\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">5) 건축물에 있는 돌인데 화강암..?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3bc3abb44fbc13d81c0e34bedca8877eda5af05\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3bc3abb44fbc13d81c0e34bedca8877eda5af05\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">6) 교문에 쓰인 돌 입니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bf75a1ccfd9512aa3a66120bd297c1fd1f07f43\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bf75a1ccfd9512aa3a66120bd297c1fd1f07f43\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">전공분야가 아니라서 줄무늬빼고 전부 비슷한 돌 같네요,,<br>부탁드려요</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
